{"ts": 1791258556.699841, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re probably stuck on the distinction between the *evaluation metric* and the *reporting*. For the Friday build, you need to describe your environment definition and then evaluate with **pass^k**: for each seed, you run the agent k times and only count it as a success if **all k runs succeed**. Since the build says \u2018at least 3 seeds,\u2019 make sure you report pass^k separately for 3+ seeds.\n\nQuick check: in your writeup, do you already have a clear one-sentence definition of state, observations, and actions? If you paste that here, I can help you tighten the eval section.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=0 messages 2m", "t": 2, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.33649379254439393}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3682647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258558.1440341, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can help, but I shouldn\u2019t just hand you the writeup text. The key idea is:\n\n- **pass^k** means the agent must succeed on **all k runs**.\n- So if any run fails, that seed does **not** count as pass^k.\n- For your report, write the result per seed, e.g. \u201cSeed 1: pass^k = yes/no\u201d and summarize across at least 3 seeds.\n\nTry this sentence starter: \u201cWe evaluate with pass^k by running the agent k times per seed and counting success only when every run succeeds.\u201d\n\nIf you want, send me your draft eval sentence and I\u2019ll help you polish it without changing the meaning.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: sure\n[activity] t=2 messages 2m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 2, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.4177124752943213}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.38826478735983944, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258559.490724, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Great\u2014paste your current eval sentence or bullets, and I\u2019ll help you tighten them. If you want a scaffold, use:\n\n\u201cEvaluation: we report pass^k on at least 3 seeds. For each seed, we run k trials and count it as success only if all k trials succeed.\u201d\n\nNow send me your version and I\u2019ll edit it with you.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=4 messages 2m", "t": 6, "activity": [{"t": 4, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.48104218812416333}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.962047686664313, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.40826478735983945, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
