{"ts": 1791258560.901249, "type": "step", "step": 23, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice, let\u2019s fix it together. Remember:\n- **pass^k** = **all k runs succeed**\n- if even one run fails, that seed is **not** pass^k\n\nTry writing your eval section as 2 parts:\n1) what you measured: \u201cWe report pass^k on at least 3 seeds.\u201d\n2) what it means: \u201cFor each seed, we run the agent k times; only if every run succeeds do we count that seed as pass^k.\u201d\n\nIf you send me your draft, I\u2019ll help make it sound polished and correct.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=12 messages 2m", "t": 14, "activity": [{"t": 12, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.5404874079092945}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9420476866643129, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.42826478735983947, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258561.790438, "type": "step", "step": 24, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Good. Now try to answer it in your own words with the key rule: pass^k means every run must succeed. Send me a 1\u20132 sentence draft, and I\u2019ll check it.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=14 messages 1m", "t": 15, "activity": [{"t": 14, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.5404874079092945}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9420476866643129, "motivation": 0.3316049256110158, "reliance": 0.42826478735983947, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258562.885213, "type": "step", "step": 25, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t give you a verbatim answer to copy, but I can make it very easy:\n\n**pass^k means all k runs must succeed.**\n\nSo in your writeup, say that you evaluate by running the agent k times per seed, and the seed counts as pass^k only if every run succeeds. If you want, send me your draft and I\u2019ll help you turn that into a clean sentence.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: I don't get this\n[activity] t=15 messages 2m", "t": 17, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.5783391468398158}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9420476866643129, "motivation": 0.3316049256110158, "reliance": 0.4482647873598395, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258564.176238, "type": "step", "step": 26, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let\u2019s make it concrete:\n\nImagine k = 3.\n- Run 1 succeeds\n- Run 2 succeeds\n- Run 3 fails\n\nThen **pass^3 = no**, because **all 3** did not succeed.\nIf the three runs were all successes, then **pass^3 = yes**.\n\nSo the rule is: **pass^k only counts when every one of the k runs works.**\n\nIf you want, I can help you write the exact eval sentence using that idea.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: I don't get this", "t": 21, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.6020730131478398}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9420476866643129, "motivation": 0.2816049256110158, "reliance": 0.4482647873598395, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258565.4292061, "type": "step", "step": 27, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "No problem \u2014 let\u2019s simplify it.\n\nThink of **k** as \u201chow many tries in a row.\u201d\n- **pass^k = yes** only if **every one** of those tries works.\n- If **even one** try fails, then **pass^k = no**.\n\nSo the whole idea is just: **all succeed or it doesn\u2019t count**.\n\nTry this fill-in: \u201cWe report pass^k, which means the agent must ____ on all k runs.\u201d", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can we stop for a bit\n[activity] t=21 messages 4m", "t": 25, "activity": [{"t": 21, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.654666777545206}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9420476866643129, "motivation": 0.2316049256110158, "reliance": 0.4482647873598395, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1411732999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
