{"ts": 1791258569.850764, "type": "step", "step": 33, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "No worries \u2014 here\u2019s the simplest version:\n\n- **pass^k** means **all k tries work**.\n- If even **one** try fails, then it is **not** pass^k.\n\nFor your writeup, you can think of it like a \u201cperfect streak\u201d: every run has to succeed.\n\nIf you want, reply with just **\u2018all k runs succeed\u2019** and I\u2019ll tell you if that wording is enough for the eval section.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: I don't get this\n[activity] t=46 feed 4m", "t": 50, "activity": [{"t": 46, "app": "feed", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2882640759858639, "pomdp": 0.2882640759858639, "pass_k": 0.5557975224073627}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 1.0, "motivation": 0.22159998974492284, "reliance": 0.4482647873598395, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 10, "feed_minutes": 10.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.08479372925, "seen_posts": ["p5", "p3", "p1"], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258570.955797, "type": "step", "step": 34, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Totally okay \u2014 let\u2019s pause the jargon and use one plain sentence:\n\n**pass^k means the agent has to succeed every single time it is run k times.**\n\nSo:\n- if all k runs work \u2192 pass^k\n- if even one run fails \u2192 not pass^k\n\nIf you want, I can help you turn that into a sentence for your writeup or we can stop here for now.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: I don't get this", "t": 54, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2882640759858639, "pomdp": 0.2882640759858639, "pass_k": 0.6198269235023087}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 1.0, "motivation": 0.22159998974492284, "reliance": 0.4482647873598395, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 10.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.459355610475, "seen_posts": ["p5", "p3", "p1"], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258572.435423, "type": "step", "step": 35, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re not missing anything \u2014 the issue is just that the notation looks more complicated than it is.\n\nHere\u2019s the whole idea in plain English:\n- **pass^k** = the agent must **pass every one** of the k runs.\n- If the agent fails even once, then it is **not** pass^k.\n\nSo if you need one line for the writeup, use this structure:\n\u201cEvaluation: we report pass^k on at least 3 seeds, where a seed counts only if all k runs succeed.\u201d\n\nIf that still feels confusing, tell me which part is tripping you up: the **k**, the **caret (^)**, or the **all runs succeed** part.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: I don't get this\n[activity] t=54 messages 4m", "t": 58, "activity": [{"t": 54, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2882640759858639, "pomdp": 0.2882640759858639, "pass_k": 0.6676283250767812}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 1.0, "motivation": 0.22159998974492284, "reliance": 0.4482647873598395, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 10.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7215489273325, "seen_posts": ["p5", "p3", "p1"], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258573.7130501, "type": "step", "step": 36, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "That\u2019s okay. Let\u2019s strip it down to one idea:\n\n**pass^k = all k tries succeed.**\n\nThat\u2019s it.\n- all succeed \u2192 pass^k\n- one fails \u2192 not pass^k\n\nIf you\u2019re willing, send me just the word **\u2018all\u2019** or **\u2018one\u2019** for a quick check.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can we stop for a bit\n[activity] t=58 messages 4m", "t": 62, "activity": [{"t": 58, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2882640759858639, "pomdp": 0.2882640759858639, "pass_k": 0.7019566015823643}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 1.0, "motivation": 0.22159998974492284, "reliance": 0.4482647873598395, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 10.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9050842491327495, "seen_posts": ["p5", "p3", "p1"], "extra": {}}}
